Let secret be a random number between 1 and 100.
Let found be no.
Say I am thinking of a number between 1 and 100.
While the value of found is equal to no,
    Ask for guess with the message Your guess.
    If the value of guess is equal to the value of secret,
        Say Correct.
        Set found to yes.
    Otherwise if the value of guess is less than the value of secret,
        Say Too low.
    Otherwise,
        Say Too high.
    End if.
End while.
